<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- 晨主之光 -->
  <LP_Meme_Lathander.label>light of the Morninglord</LP_Meme_Lathander.label>
  <!-- 洛山达是黎明、新生与复苏之神。每一个早晨都是他的恩赐，每一具不死之躯都是对他的冒犯。文化的守护神固定为洛山达。\n\n被动：清晨5～8点全局工作速度+5%；殖民地每有一个死灵造物，信徒心情-1（最多-5）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Lathander.description>Lathander is the god of dawn, rebirth and renewal. Every morning is his gift, and every undead body an affront to him. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Lathander.\n\nPassive: global work speed +5% from 5 to 8 in the morning; believers get mood -1 for each necromantic construct in the colony (up to -5).</LP_Meme_Lathander.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->晨曦 | memeAdjective->黎明 | memeHyphenPrefix->晨 | memeConcept->黎明 | memeConcept->新生 | memeLeaderNoun->晨祭司 | memeLeaderAdjective->晨光 | memeMoralist->晨颂者 -->
  <LP_Meme_Lathander.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;dawnlit</li>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;dawn</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Auro</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;dawn</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;rebirth</li>
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;dawn priest</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;morning-bright</li>
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;dawn singer</li>
  </LP_Meme_Lathander.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 晨主 -->
  <LP_Meme_Lathander.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>the Morninglord</LP_Meme_Lathander.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>
  <!-- 正义之秤 -->
  <LP_Meme_Tyr.label>scales of justice</LP_Meme_Tyr.label>
  <!-- 提尔是蒙眼的正义之神，用一只断手托起天平。罪人必受审判，无辜者必得庇护。文化的守护神固定为提尔。\n\n被动：审判仪式和释放囚犯给提尔的神眷再×2。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Tyr.description>Tyr is the blindfolded god of justice, holding up the scales with a severed hand. The guilty must be judged and the innocent protected. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Tyr.\n\nPassive: divine favor to Tyr from judgment rituals and releasing prisoners ×2 more.</LP_Meme_Tyr.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->公正 | memeAdjective->审判 | memeHyphenPrefix->秤 | memeConcept->正义 | memeConcept->律法 | memeLeaderNoun->大法官 | memeLeaderAdjective->公正 | memeMoralist->审判者 -->
