    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;judging</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Justo</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;justice</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;law</li>
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;high justice</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;just</li>
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;judge</li>
  </LP_Meme_Tyr.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 蒙眼的审判者 -->
  <LP_Meme_Tyr.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>the blindfolded judge</LP_Meme_Tyr.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>
  <!-- 魔网之女 -->
  <LP_Meme_Mystra.label>lady of the Weave</LP_Meme_Mystra.label>
  <!-- 密斯特拉是魔法女神，魔网的守护者。每一道法术都从她的织网上取走一根丝线。文化的守护神固定为密斯特拉。\n\n被动：身上带着魔法物品的信徒心情+2（魔网的礼物）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Mystra.description>Mystra is the goddess of magic, guardian of the Weave. Every spell draws a thread from her web. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Mystra.\n\nPassive: believers carrying magic items get mood +2 (gift of the Weave).</LP_Meme_Mystra.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->魔网 | memeAdjective->星辉 | memeHyphenPrefix->网 | memeConcept->魔网 | memeConcept->奥秘 | memeLeaderNoun->织网者 | memeLeaderAdjective->星辉 | memeMoralist->守网人 -->
