    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;starlit</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Weave</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;the Weave</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;mysteries</li>
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;weaver</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;starlit</li>
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;Weave warden</li>
  </LP_Meme_Mystra.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 魔网之母 -->
  <LP_Meme_Mystra.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>mother of the Weave</LP_Meme_Mystra.modExtensions.0.deityTitle>
  <!-- 亡者之判 -->
  <LP_Meme_Kelemvor.label>judgment of the dead</LP_Meme_Kelemvor.label>
  <!-- 凯兰沃是死亡之神，他公正地审判每一个亡魂。死亡不可怕，可怕的是拒绝死亡。文化的守护神固定为凯兰沃。\n\n被动：入葬给凯兰沃的神眷再×2；看到尸体不难受（必带的「尸体：不在乎」）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Kelemvor.description>Kelemvor is the god of death, justly judging every soul. Death is not frightening; refusing death is. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Kelemvor.\n\nPassive: divine favor to Kelemvor from burials ×2 more; not bothered by seeing corpses (the mandatory "corpses: don't care").</LP_Meme_Kelemvor.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->灰袍 | memeAdjective->安息 | memeHyphenPrefix->冥 | memeConcept->安息 | memeConcept->审判 | memeLeaderNoun->守墓人 | memeLeaderAdjective->灰袍 | memeMoralist->送灵人 -->
