  <!-- 风暴之怒 -->
  <LP_Meme_Talos.label>storm's fury</LP_Meme_Talos.label>
  <!-- 塔洛斯是风暴与毁灭之神。雷霆是他的声音，野火是他的足迹。文化的守护神固定为塔洛斯。\n\n被动：雷暴天气里信徒心情+4（风暴之子）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Talos.description>Talos is the god of storms and destruction. Thunder is his voice, wildfire his footprint. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Talos.\n\nPassive: believers get mood +4 in thunderstorms (child of the storm).</LP_Meme_Talos.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->风暴 | memeAdjective->雷霆 | memeHyphenPrefix->雷 | memeConcept->风暴 | memeConcept->毁灭 | memeLeaderNoun->唤雷者 | memeLeaderAdjective->狂暴 | memeMoralist->风暴使者 -->
  <LP_Meme_Talos.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;storm</li>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;thundering</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Fulmo</li>
