  <!-- 黑暗之主 -->
  <LP_Meme_Bane.label>lord of darkness</LP_Meme_Bane.label>
  <!-- 班恩是暴政之神，用黑手统治一切。秩序来自恐惧，恐惧来自力量。文化的守护神固定为班恩。\n\n被动：本文化的奴隶主人手下，奴隶压制下降速度×0.7。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Bane.description>Bane is the god of tyranny, ruling all with the Black Hand. Order comes from fear, and fear comes from power. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Bane.\n\nPassive: under slave masters of this culture, slave suppression falls ×0.7 as fast.</LP_Meme_Bane.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->黑手 | memeAdjective->铁腕 | memeHyphenPrefix->暴 | memeConcept->暴政 | memeConcept->统治 | memeLeaderNoun->暴君 | memeLeaderAdjective->铁腕 | memeMoralist->黑手执事 -->
  <LP_Meme_Bane.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;Black-Handed</li>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;iron-fisted</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Tyranno</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;tyranny</li>
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;domination</li>
