  <!-- 夜之女士 -->
  <LP_Meme_Shar.label>Lady of the Night</LP_Meme_Shar.label>
  <!-- 莎尔是黑暗与遗忘之神，夜之女士。她承诺抹去一切痛苦——连同一切记忆。文化的守护神固定为莎尔。\n\n被动：夜里（22点～5点）全局工作速度+8%。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Shar.description>Shar is the goddess of darkness and loss, the Lady of the Night. She promises to erase all pain, along with all memory. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Shar.\n\nPassive: global work speed +8% at night (22 to 5).</LP_Meme_Shar.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->暗夜 | memeAdjective->遗忘 | memeHyphenPrefix->夜 | memeConcept->黑暗 | memeConcept->遗忘 | memeLeaderNoun->暗月祭司 | memeLeaderAdjective->幽暗 | memeMoralist->遗忘者 -->
