  <!-- 熔炉巨人 -->
  <LP_Meme_Surtr.label>forge giants</LP_Meme_Surtr.label>
  <!-- 苏尔特是火巨人之王，世界熔炉的主人。巨人生来高贵，铁与火是他们的语言。文化的守护神固定为苏尔特。\n\n被动：锻造速度+10%。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Surtr.description>Surtur is the king of fire giants and master of the world forge. Giants are born noble, and iron and fire are their language. The culture's patron deity is fixed to Surtur.\n\nPassive: smithing speed +10%.</LP_Meme_Surtr.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->熔火 | memeAdjective->巨人 | memeHyphenPrefix->炉 | memeConcept->熔炉 | memeConcept->位阶 | memeLeaderNoun->炉王 | memeLeaderAdjective->熔火 | memeMoralist->守炉人 -->
