  <!-- 众神殿 -->
  <LP_Meme_Pantheon.label>pantheon</LP_Meme_Pantheon.label>
  <!-- 众神各司其职，凡人可以向任何一位祈求。可以和一位主神共存。\n\n被动：祈祷神眷×1.25；更换守护神的冷却减半（没有主神时）；圣坛上可以为任何一位可信奉的神举办庆典（每神每年一次，每年最多4场）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Pantheon.description>Each god has its own domain, and mortals may pray to any of them. Can coexist with one main god.\n\nPassive: prayer divine favor ×1.25; changing patron deity cooldown halved (with no main god); the altar can hold festivals for any worshippable god (once per god per year, up to 4 per year).</LP_Meme_Pantheon.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->众神 | memeAdjective->万神 | memeHyphenPrefix->神 | memeConcept->众神 | memeLeaderNoun->众神之仆 | memeLeaderAdjective->神圣 | memeMoralist->司祭 -->
