    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;servant of the gods</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;holy</li>
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;officiant</li>
  </LP_Meme_Pantheon.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 不跪之人 -->
  <LP_Meme_Defiant.label>the unkneeling</LP_Meme_Defiant.label>
  <!-- 神明不过是更强大的存在，凡人不欠他们什么。\n\n被动：受到的神术效果×0.75（敌我都算，和无神者的×0.5取较小值）；心智抗性+5%；殖民地有圣坛时心情-2（讨厌的神龛）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Defiant.description>Gods are just more powerful beings; mortals owe them nothing.\n\nPassive: divine magic received ×0.75 (from friend or foe, takes the smaller of this and the godless ×0.5); mind resistance +5%; mood -2 when the colony has an altar (hated shrine).</LP_Meme_Defiant.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->不跪 | memeAdjective->凡人 | memeHyphenPrefix->凡 | memeConcept->自主 | memeLeaderNoun->首领 | memeLeaderAdjective->倔强 | memeMoralist->说理人 -->
