    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;chief</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective-&gt;stubborn</li>
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;reasoner</li>
  </LP_Meme_Defiant.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 魔网至上 -->
  <LP_Meme_Weave.label>supremacy of the Weave</LP_Meme_Weave.label>
  <!-- 魔法是世界最高的真理，掌握魔网的人理应站在顶端。\n\n被动：耐瑟卷轴研读经验×1.15；模组施法能力（神术、卷轴、巫妖法术）冷却×0.95。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Weave.description>Magic is the highest truth of the world; those who master the Weave belong at the top.\n\nPassive: Netherese scroll study XP ×1.15; mod casting abilities (divine magic, scrolls, lich spells) cooldown ×0.95.</LP_Meme_Weave.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->奥术 | memeAdjective->织法 | memeHyphenPrefix->法 | memeConcept->魔网 | memeLeaderNoun->大法师 | memeLeaderAdjective->奥术 | memeMoralist->讲法者 -->
