    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;lecturer</li>
  </LP_Meme_Weave.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- 永夜不朽 -->
  <LP_Meme_Undeath.label>undying eternal night</LP_Meme_Undeath.label>
  <!-- 死亡只是一道门槛，跨过去的人才配得上永恒。\n\n被动：本文化的巫妖每天确信度+1%；巫妖复生时全体心情+3（主人归来，由「亡灵观：神圣」给出）。 -->
  <LP_Meme_Undeath.description>Death is just a threshold, and only those who cross it deserve eternity.\n\nPassive: this culture's liches gain +1% certainty per day; everyone gets mood +3 when a lich revives (the master returns, given by "undeath: sacred").</LP_Meme_Undeath.description>
  <!-- memeAdjective->永夜 | memeAdjective->不朽 | memeHyphenPrefix->冥 | memeConcept->不朽 | memeLeaderNoun->命匣守护者 | memeLeaderAdjective->不朽 | memeMoralist->亡语者 -->
  <LP_Meme_Undeath.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;eternal-night</li>
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;undying</li>
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;Necro</li>
